(rail-stage)
*title Rail launch and branch
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 rocket start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=0 long=0 lat=0 vel=0 gama=45 psi=90 time=0 wt=1000
  *file parent.dat time tseg tmark plength vel wt
  *segment 1 rail
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.01
    *reset tmark=0
    *prop thrust=(rail-thrust) mdot=(zero-mdot)
    *rail launch cfstat=0.15 cfslid=0.01
    *when plength>20 goto 2
  *segment 2 free burn
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.02
    *prop thrust=(rail-thrust) mdot=(zero-mdot)
    *when time>4 goto 3
  *segment 3 stage
    *reset wt=500 tmark=0
    *increment vel=10
    *when tseg>0 stop
*trajectory 2 payload start on 1
  *initial from trajectory 1, segment 3
  *file child.dat time tseg vel wt
  *segment 1 deploy
    *reset wt=50
    *increment vel=5 dxb=0.5 dyb=0.1 dzb=0.0
    *when tseg>0 goto 2
  *segment 2 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.2 dt=0.02
    *when tseg=2 stop
*end
